{"type":"message","id":"05599504","parentId":"dba533b6","timestamp":"2026-01-31T04:18:43.696Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You are the CRITIC agent for the HHC Brooklyn Dental bid takeoff (Project #26202103). This is the FINAL review pass after the 300 DPI re-run.\n\n## Your Job\nReview the updated v2 executor output against the original v1 output and previous critic findings. Issue final verdicts.\n\n## Files to Read\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/executor_output_demo_groupA_v2.json (NEW — 300 DPI results)\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/executor_output_demo_groupBC.json (unchanged — Items 9, 10, 11, 23)\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/critic_review_demo.json (previous critic review — check if flags are resolved)\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/task_packets_demo.json\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/room_schedule.json\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/door_schedule.json\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/partition_schedule.json\n\n## Spot-Check Drawing (300 DPI)\n- /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/sheets-300dpi/part3/page-10.png (DM-100.00)\n\n## What Changed in v2\n- Item 15: 200→120 SF (2 locations not 4)\n- Item 19: 4→3 EA\n- Item 20: 24→12 LF (1 location not 4)\n- Item 21: 24→12 SF (2 locations not 4)\n- Multiple keynote corrections\n- All items now MEDIUM or HIGH confidence (was 7 LOW)\n- Millwork vs shelving keynotes now distinguishable (KN2/KN10 vs KN17)\n- Fridge confirmed at 1 EA\n- Concrete pad keynote identified as KN28\n\n## Previous Critical Issues — Check Resolution\n1. Item 23 math error (used 15 doors, should be 19) — recalculate with v2 numbers\n2. Item 11 no 4th floor drawings — still unresolved (no new data)\n3. Items 13+20 overlap — NOW RESOLVED per v2 keynote distinction\n\n## Run These Checks\n1. Do the v2 quantity changes make sense given the keynote corrections?\n2. Recalculate Item 23 carting rollup with ALL v2 numbers\n3. Are any remaining flags from v1 critic still open?\n4. Any NEW issues introduced by the quantity changes?\n5. Final confidence assessment for each item\n6. Cross-check: do all partition/door/fixture counts add up consistently?\n\n## Output\nWrite to: /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/critic_review_demo_v2.json\n\nSame format as v1 critic review. Add a \"resolution_status\" for each previous flag (RESOLVED / STILL_OPEN / NEW).\n\nAlso include a \"final_quantities\" array with the recommended quantity for every item 8-23, incorporating all corrections."},{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/jpeg"}],"timestamp":1769833123694}}
