{"type":"message","id":"41ff64eb","parentId":"bc978f32","timestamp":"2026-01-31T04:18:49.701Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_019UtT5FsU1KQzmY527wyga8","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"source_sheet\": \"A-801.00 (Door Schedule) - part3/page-30\",\n  \"confidence\": \"MODERATE - extracted from rendered image; some columns were difficult to read at resolution. Verify against original PDF.\",\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"All doors appear to be HM (Hollow Metal) doors in HM frames, 1-3/4\\\" thick\",\n    \"Door sizes referenced by letter codes (A, B, C, D, etc.) - exact dimensions need verification from size key on sheet\",\n    \"Hardware sets referenced as H-1, J-1, U-1/U-2/U-3 etc. - full hardware descriptions in spec section 087100 (18 pages)\",\n    \"Fire ratings: Most doors appear non-rated; Door 1 (Mechanical Room) appears to have 3/4 HR rating\",\n    \"Door 9 marked NOT USED\",\n    \"Frame types: A = standard welded frame, C = fire-rated frame (verify)\"\n  ],\n  \"door_size_key\": {\n    \"_note\": \"COULD NOT FULLY READ size key from image - dimensions below are ESTIMATED based on typical dental suite doors. MUST VERIFY.\",\n    \"A\": \"3'-0\\\" x 7'-0\\\" (estimated - standard utility/corridor door)\",\n    \"B\": \"3'-0\\\" x 7'-0\\\" (estimated - standard room door)\",\n    \"C\": \"3'-0\\\" x 7'-0\\\" (estimated - ADA restroom, may be wider)\",\n    \"D\": \"3'-4.5\\\" x 6'-11.5\\\" (from bid breakdown - sliding pocket door size)\"\n  },\n  \"hardware_set_key\": {\n    \"_note\": \"Hardware set details in spec section 087100. Columns show H-1, J-1, U-1/U-2/U-3 which likely refer to hinges, jamb type, and lockset type.\",\n    \"H-1\": \"Hinge set (likely 3 hinges, 4.5\\\" x 4.5\\\" heavy weight)\",\n    \"J-1\": \"Standard jamb/strike\",\n    \"U-1\": \"Standard lockset - passage or privacy\",\n    \"U-2\": \"Lockset with fire-rated hardware\",\n    \"U-3\": \"ADA compliant lockset/privacy set\"\n  },\n  \"doors